  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am at the zoo. I love animals! Look at the elephant. It is gray. Is it small? No, it is very big! Wow!",
      "Now I see a donkey. It is brown. Is it big? No, it is small. It has big ears. Is it funny? Yes, it is funny!",
      "I see a duck. It is small and yellow. Is it a big duck? No, it is not. The duck is my favorite animal. What is your favorite? What color is it?"
    ],
